     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The rule of the story",
     "texto": [
      "The **imparfait** presents the setting or an action in progress; the **passé composé** presents the event that moves the story forward.",
      "Example: **Quand je suis arrivé, il pleuvait** (when I arrived, it was raining). **Soudain** and **puis** can help order the events, but they do not decide on their own which tense to use."
